# `collections.delete_item`

Delete a collection item by id.

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.collections.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `collection` | `string` |
| `id` | `string` |

## Returns

`Deletion` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `deleted` | `bool` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call collections.delete_item --json '{ "collection": "", "id": "" }'
```

Kind: command.

## Example response

```json
{
  "id": "note-checkout-notes",
  "deleted": true
}
```
